      "orig": "This Amendment is entered into effective October 1,1996 (\"Amendment Date\") by and between NETGEAR, Inc. (\"NETGEAR\"), a wholly owned subsidiary of Bay Networks, Inc., and Ingram Micro (\"Distributor\") acting on behalf of itself and its affiliates.",
      "text": "This Amendment is entered into effective October 1,1996 (\"Amendment Date\") by and between NETGEAR, Inc. (\"NETGEAR\"), a wholly owned subsidiary of Bay Networks, Inc., and Ingram Micro (\"Distributor\") acting on behalf of itself and its affiliates."
    },
